#: ../../reference_manual/layers_and_masks/vector_layers.rst:39
msgid "Vector Layers"
msgstr "Vektorové vrstvy"

#: ../../reference_manual/layers_and_masks/vector_layers.rst:43
msgid "What is a Vector Layer?"
msgstr "Čo je vektorová vrstva?"

#: ../../reference_manual/layers_and_masks/vector_layers.rst:45
msgid ""
"A Vector Layer, also known as a Shape Layer, is a type of layers that "
"contains only vector graphics elements."
msgstr ""
"Vektorová vrstva, tiež známa ako vrstva tvarov, je typ vrstvy, ktorá "
"obsahuje iba vektorové grafické prvky."

#: ../../reference_manual/layers_and_masks/vector_layers.rst:47
msgid ""
"The vector layer appear in :program:`Krita`'s :ref:`Layers docker "
"<layer_docker>` with the following icon |icon_vectorlayer| right to the "
"layer thumbnail."
msgstr ""
"Vektorová vrstva sa v :ref:`dokeri Vrstvy <layer_docker>` programu :program:"
"`Krita` zobrazuje s nasledujúcou ikonou |icon_vectorlayer| napravo od "
"miniatúry vrstvy."

#: ../../reference_manual/layers_and_masks/vector_layers.rst:51
msgid ".. image:: /images/vector/Vectorlayer.png"
msgstr ".. image:: images/en/Vectorlayer.png"

#: ../../reference_manual/layers_and_masks/vector_layers.rst:52
msgid "About Vector Graphics & Raster Images"
msgstr "O vektorovej grafike a rastrových obrázkoch"

#: ../../reference_manual/layers_and_masks/vector_layers.rst:54
msgid ""
":program:`Krita` is primarily a `Raster Graphics <https://en.wikipedia.org/"
"wiki/Raster_graphics>`__ editing tool, which means that most of the editing "
"changes the values of the pixels on the raster that makes up the image."
msgstr ""
":program:`Krita` je primárne nástroj na úpravu `rastrových obrázkov <https://"
"en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Raster_graphics>`__, čo znamená, že väčšina úprav mení "
"hodnoty pixelov v rastri, z ktorého sa obraz skladá."

#: ../../reference_manual/layers_and_masks/vector_layers.rst:56
msgid ""
"A `Vector Graphics <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Vector_graphics>`__ "
"editing tool will use mathematics to describe shapes. Shapes can be edited "
"at any time (modified, deleted). Because it uses formulas, vector graphics "
"can be resized to any size without any 'pixel' or 'blur' effect."
msgstr ""
"Nástroj na úpravu `vektorovej grafiky <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/"
"Vector_graphics>`__ používa matematiku na popis tvarov. Tvary možno "
"kedykoľvek upraviť (zmeniť, odstrániť). Vďaka použitiu vzorcov môže byť "
"vektorová grafika zmenená na ľubovoľnú veľkosť bez efektu 'pixelovania' "
"alebo 'rozmazania'."

#: ../../reference_manual/layers_and_masks/vector_layers.rst:58
msgid ""
"Vector Graphics are useful to generate logo and banners. They're also useful "
"to manipulate and render texts (a vector graphic text can be edited where a "
"rasterized text can't)."
msgstr ""
"Vektorová grafika sa hodí na tvorbu log a bannerov. Je tiež užitočná na "
"manipuláciu a vykresľovanie textov (vektorový text možno editovať tam, kde "
"rastrový text nie je možné)."

#: ../../reference_manual/layers_and_masks/vector_layers.rst:63
msgid "Creating a Vector Layer"
msgstr "Vektorové vrstvy"

#: ../../reference_manual/layers_and_masks/vector_layers.rst:65
msgid ""
"In :ref:`Layers docker <layer_docker>`, click on dropdown arrow right to the "
"*Add layer* |icon_add| button; this will popup a sub-menu with the :guilabel:"
"`Add Vector Layer` entry."
msgstr ""
"V :ref:`dokeri Vrstvy <layer_docker>` kliknite na šípku rozbaľovacieho "
"zoznamu napravo od tlačidla *Pridať vrstvu* |icon_add|; zobrazí sa podponuka "
"s položkou :guilabel:`Add Vector Layer`."

#: ../../reference_manual/layers_and_masks/vector_layers.rst:67
msgid "Default shortcut to create a new vector layer is :kbd:`Shift + Ins`."
msgstr ""
"Predvolená klávesová skratka na vytvorenie novej vektorovej vrstvy je :kbd:"
"`Shift + Ins`."

